130 PRINT "5. SOUND SWEEPS ON VOICE 2 AND VOICE 5"
140 SOUND 2,4000,180,2,1500,120,1:SOUND 5,9000,180,2,5000,250,0
150 SLEEP 4
160 PRINT "6. FILTER: VOICE 1 PLAIN, VOICE 4 FILTERED"
